# GTT: in-mission radio and hint lines, from the GTT pools of SLOT.DAT
# (ANALYSIS/11).  Rules for every entry here:
#   - the block is re-laid-out when it is written back, so a translation may be
#     LONGER than the English line -- it can grow into the bytes the suffix-merged
#     fragments used to occupy.  `budget N B` is this line's share of that slack
#     (English length + slack/n), and `po_lint` fails the build with
#     `gtt-budget` when it is exceeded;
#   - the game stores a line break as a two-character `\n`, so keep the same
#     number of lines as the source.


#. GTT pool 0x1c7a72cb block 0x2730 (id 0x66, record 246), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a72cb/0x2730/0
msgid "You should take out that weapon first."
msgstr "先干掉那件武器。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a72cb block 0x27a0 (id 0x69, record 246), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a72cb/0x27a0/0
msgid "It's reloading missiles. Now's your chance!"
msgstr "它在装填导弹。趁现在！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a72cb block 0x2810 (id 0x55, record 246), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a72cb/0x2810/0
msgid "Now, close in on it!"
msgstr "上，贴过去！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a72cb block 0x2870 (id 0x74, record 246), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a72cb/0x2870/0
msgid "It's about to eject the AI pod! Hurry!"
msgstr "它要弹出AI舱了！快！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a72cb block 0x28f0 (id 0x77, record 246), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a72cb/0x28f0/0
