#: gtt/0x1c7c720b/0x960/0
msgid "Snake, try to make contact with Amanda."
msgstr "SNAKE，试着联系阿曼达。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b720b block 0xdf0 (id 0x87, record 108), budget 87 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf20b block 0xa70 (id 0x87, record 114), budget 87 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7c720b block 0x9d0 (id 0x87, record 120), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b720b/0xdf0/0
#: gtt/0x1c7bf20b/0xa70/0
#: gtt/0x1c7c720b/0x9d0/0
msgid "Amanda should be at the supply depot on the banana plantation."
msgstr "阿曼达应该在香蕉种植园的补给站。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x0 (id 0x65, record 174), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x0/0
msgid "Cross the bridge and head north."
msgstr "过桥往北走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x70 (id 0xcf, record 174), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x70/0
msgid "I can see the transport route."
msgstr "我看到运输路线了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x70 (id 0xcf, record 174), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x70/1
msgid "And it seems the truck that we saw at the train terminal used it recently."
msgstr "我们在火车站看到的卡车似乎最近用过。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x140 (id 0xbc, record 174), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x140/0
msgid "See the opposite shore?"
msgstr "看到对岸了吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x140 (id 0xbc, record 174), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x140/1
msgid "That's the route the truck took from the train terminal."
msgstr "卡车从火车站出发走的就是这条路。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x200 (id 0x81, record 174), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x200/0
msgid "You can use the walkway along the water main to cross."
msgstr "你可以走水管旁的通道过去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x290 (id 0x70, record 174), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x290/0
msgid "It's a two-level walkway, one path on top of the other."
msgstr "那是双层通道，上下各一条。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x300 (id 0x8a, record 174), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x300/0
msgid "The upper route's falling apart, but the lower one should be fine."
msgstr "上层快塌了，下层应该没问题。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x390 (id 0x70, record 174), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x390/0
msgid "You should be able to climb up there with two people."
msgstr "两个人应该能爬上去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x5a0 (id 0x83, record 174), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x5a0/0
msgid "Quick, while the enemy's not looking, hang down from the handrail."
msgstr "快，趁敌人没注意，从扶手上吊下去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x630 (id 0x80, record 174), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x630/0
msgid "I think I'd wet my pants if I had to cross that..."
msgstr "要我走那儿我准得吓尿……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x6b0 (id 0x84, record 174), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x6b0/0
msgid ""
"Good, you've reached the\n"
"transport route. Follow it to their base."
msgstr ""
"好，你到了\n"
"运输路线。沿它去他们基地。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x740 (id 0x9f, record 174), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x740/0
msgid ""
"That's a truck route you're on.\n"
"Their base is up ahead. Move out."
msgstr ""
"你走的是卡车路线。\n"
"他们基地就在前面。出发。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x7e0 (id 0x77, record 174), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x7e0/0
msgid "Their base should be beyond that transport route."
msgstr "他们基地应该在那条运输路线尽头。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x860 (id 0x66, record 174), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x860/0
msgid "None of us have ever been that far before."
msgstr "我们谁都没去过那么远。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x8d0 (id 0x7a, record 174), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x8d0/0
msgid ""
"They've got the road blocked off.\n"
"Think you can cut through?"
msgstr ""
"他们把路封了。\n"
"你能穿过去吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x950 (id 0xa9, record 174), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x950/0
msgid ""
"Damn, those guys are just hanging\n"
"around that stopped truck."
msgstr ""
"该死，那些家伙就守在\n"
"那辆停着的卡车旁。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0x950 (id 0xa9, record 174), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0x950/1
msgid "You've got to cut through."
msgstr "你得穿过去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xa00 (id 0xab, record 174), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xa00/0
msgid "There's a bunker on the mountainside."
msgstr "山腰有个碉堡。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xa00 (id 0xab, record 174), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xa00/1
msgid "Put the odds in your favor by seizing it."
msgstr "夺下它，占点优势。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xab0 (id 0xb6, record 174), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xab0/0
msgid "That bunker's in a perfect position."
msgstr "那碉堡位置绝佳。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xab0 (id 0xb6, record 174), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xab0/1
msgid "The battle will be much easier if you capture it."
msgstr "拿下它战斗会轻松得多。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xb70 (id 0x94, record 174), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xb70/0
msgid "Please, Snake. Make sure they can never use that bunker again."
msgstr "拜托了，SNAKE。确保他们再也用不了那碉堡。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xc10 (id 0x91, record 174), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xc10/0
msgid "The enemy base is in the mountains to the north. Keep heading north."
msgstr "敌基地在北面山中。继续往北。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xcb0 (id 0x85, record 174), budget 87 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0xed0 (id 0x85, record 180), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xcb0/0
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0xed0/0
msgid "Looks like the entrance is on the mountainside. Better hurry, Snake."
msgstr "入口似乎在山腰。快一点，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xd40 (id 0x71, record 174), budget 71 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0xf60 (id 0x71, record 180), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xd40/0
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0xf60/0
msgid "Even we have never been past there."
msgstr "连我们也没去过那里面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b724b block 0xdc0 (id 0x8b, record 174), budget 87 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0xfe0 (id 0x8b, record 180), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b724b/0xdc0/0
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0xfe0/0
msgid "There should be an entrance about halfway up the mountain. Be careful."
msgstr "山腰处应该有入口。小心。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b72cb block 0x0 (id 0xc2, record 270), budget 82 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b72cb/0x0/0
msgid "That door won't open until the state of alert's lifted."
msgstr "警戒解除前那扇门不会开。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b72cb block 0x0 (id 0xc2, record 270), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b72cb/0x0/1
msgid "Hang tight 'til then."
msgstr "先忍着别动。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b72cb block 0x160 (id 0xc0, record 270), budget 86 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b72cb/0x160/0
msgid "Enemies that coordinate their attacks are too much trouble when you're solo."
msgstr "敌人协同进攻，单打独斗太麻烦。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b72cb block 0x160 (id 0xc0, record 270), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b72cb/0x160/1
msgid "Just steer clear."
msgstr "避开他们。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7b730b block 0x0 (id 0xb6, record 312), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c7b730b/0x0/0
