msgid ""
"The base is beyond that fort.\n"
"You've got to get past it somehow."
msgstr ""
"基地在那座堡垒后面。\n"
"你得想办法过去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x90 (id 0x7b, record 180), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x90/0
msgid ""
"You have to get through that fort.\n"
"Their base is beyond it."
msgstr ""
"你得穿过那座堡垒。\n"
"他们的基地就在后面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x110 (id 0x6a, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x110/0
msgid "There may be snipers on the roof."
msgstr "屋顶上可能有狙击手。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x180 (id 0x55, record 180), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x180/0
msgid "Look out for those guns!"
msgstr "小心那些机枪！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x1e0 (id 0xc0, record 180), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x1e0/0
msgid "Looks like there's ladder leading down to the fort."
msgstr "好像有梯子通向堡垒下面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x1e0 (id 0xc0, record 180), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x1e0/1
msgid "I'll bet security's extremely tight."
msgstr "我猜戒备极其森严。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x2a0 (id 0x6e, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x2a0/0
msgid "Isn't there some other way besides the ladder?"
msgstr "除了梯子就没别的路了吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x310 (id 0x67, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x310/0
msgid "They will be watching those ladders closely."
msgstr "他们会紧盯那些梯子。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x380 (id 0xb4, record 180), budget 79 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x380/0
msgid "Charging in right through the center is asking for a firefight."
msgstr "从正中间冲进去等于找死。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x380 (id 0xb4, record 180), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x380/1
msgid "Way too dangerous."
msgstr "太危险了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x440 (id 0x65, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x440/0
msgid "Isn't there any other way to get in?"
msgstr "就没有别的办法进去吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x4b0 (id 0x97, record 180), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x4b0/0
msgid "Can't you get in through there? I don't thinking climbing up's an option..."
msgstr "不能从那里进去吗？爬上去恐怕不行……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x550 (id 0x6f, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x550/0
msgid "Can you get around to the outside from there?"
msgstr "能从那里绕到外面吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x5c0 (id 0x83, record 180), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x5c0/0
