msgstr "地下室和一楼之间有平台吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x650 (id 0x84, record 180), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x650/0
msgid "If you can find a handhold somewhere, you might be able to move along it."
msgstr "要是能找到抓手，也许能沿墙移动。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x6e0 (id 0x67, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x6e0/0
msgid "Looks like you could get in from the side."
msgstr "看来可以从侧面进去。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x750 (id 0x65, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x750/0
msgid "Can you make it there by hanging?"
msgstr "能吊着过去吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x7c0 (id 0x6a, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x7c0/0
msgid "Great! It looks like you can get in from there!"
msgstr "太好了！看来能从那儿进去！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x830 (id 0x6b, record 180), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x830/0
msgid "Good, you're in. Keep going, Boss."
msgstr ""

