msgstr "快到敌军基地了。再加把劲！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x9c0 (id 0xb2, record 180), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x9c0/0
msgid "That's some camouflage job."
msgstr "这伪装做得真绝。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7bf24b block 0x9c0 (id 0xb2, record 180), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c7bf24b/0x9c0/1
